'' A METHOD OF A TYPE DECLARED IN 'extern "c"' is mangled with its written case, as fbc does (_ZN2G11A3fooEu7INTEGER); tiko named every such method plain 'foo', and two namespaces' methods collided (fbc's virtual/virtual.bas). Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/externc-method-mangle.bas -o tests/codegen/externcmethodmangle.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/externcmethodmangle.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: B
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: A1
